<article class="env-definition" id="04YJ">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/04YJ">Definition <span data-tag="04YJ">100.7.5</span>.</a> Let $\mathcal{P}$ be a property of germs of schemes which is smooth local. Let $\mathcal{X}$ be an algebraic stack. Let $x \in |\mathcal{X}|$. We say $\mathcal{X}$ <em>has property $\mathcal{P}$ at $x$</em> if any of the equivalent conditions of Lemma <a href="/tag/04YI" data-tag="04YI">100.7.4</a> holds. </p>
